*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : LON0012
*> PURPOSE : LOAN LIMITS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-07-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-12-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 759
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0012.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    *> LOAN TO VALUE PERCENT
    05 L-TV               PIC 9(3).
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> MORTGAGE INSURANCE REQUIRED
    05 MI-IND             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 MI-REQUIRED VALUE 'Y'.
    05 WS-RADJ            PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM CHECK-LTV
    DISPLAY "MI-IND=" MI-IND
    DISPLAY "WS-RADJ=" WS-RADJ
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-LTV.
    *> MORTGAGE INSURANCE REQUIREMENT
    IF L-TV > 90
        SET MI-REQUIRED TO TRUE
        MOVE 0.0025 TO WS-RADJ
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO MI-IND
    END-IF.
